  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/10/ComQuedaSorteigCadafalsFiraOnda19.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 304px;\" /></p>\n<p>El mat&iacute; d&#39;aquest diumenge s&#39;ha fet al Teatre M&ograve;naco el sorteig de cadafals per a Fira d&#39;Onda 2019. Paral&middot;lelament s&#39;ha continuat repartint el programa de festes, aix&iacute; com cartells de Fira i de bous.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/10/IMG_6252.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Com encara queden programes, dilluns a partir de les 18 hores continuaran repartint-se al M&ograve;naco, conjuntament amb la venda d&#39;entrades.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals2019irepartimentprograma/img_6157.jpg\" alt=\"img_6157\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals2019irepartimentprograma/img_6158.jpg\" alt=\"img_6158\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals2019irepartimentprograma/img_6160.jpg\" alt=\"img_6160\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals2019irepartimentprograma/img_6161.jpg\" alt=\"img_6161\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals2019irepartimentprograma/img_6162.jpg\" alt=\"img_6162\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals2019irepartimentprograma/img_6163.jpg\" alt=\"img_6163\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcadafals2019irepartimentprograma/img_6164.jpg\" alt=\"img